      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Destination Handover, Odometer Sign-Off &amp; Joint Condition Inspection for Bike Transportation In Tharangambadi</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>At the destination, the delivery handover for two‑wheelers and motorcycles follows a strict, three‑step protocol designed to guarantee that the vehicle’s condition and mileage match the original dispatch records. The process is conducted in daylight to allow the driver to visually confirm the bike’s appearance against the pickup photos and to read the odometer accurately.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Daylight Condition Re‑Inspection</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The receiving agent opens the motorcycle’s service door and compares the exterior and interior surfaces to the high‑resolution images taken at pickup. Any new scratches, dents, or fluid leaks are noted on a digital checklist. The agent also confirms that the tyre tread depth, brake pads, and battery are unchanged.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Odometer Verification Against LR Bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The agent records the current mileage on the motorcycle’s odometer and cross‑checks it with the number printed on the LR bilty. The difference is calculated; if it exceeds the agreed mileage allowance, a discrepancy report is generated and the driver is asked to provide an explanation.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>This step ensures that the vehicle has not been tampered with during transit</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Signed Condition Sign‑Off</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Once the condition and mileage checks are complete, both parties sign a digital or paper handover sheet. The signature is captured electronically on a tablet or on a printed form, and the sheet is then uploaded to the logistics management system.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>The signed document becomes part of the shipment’s audit trail, proving that the motorcycle was delivered in the agreed condition</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Throughout the handover, the driver retains a copy of the original pickup photos and the LR bilty for reference. Any discrepancies discovered are logged in the incident management module, triggering an internal review.</p>
<p>By conducting the inspection in daylight, verifying mileage against the LR bilty, and obtaining a signed sign‑off, the company protects both the customer and the carrier from post‑delivery disputes and maintains the integrity of its service quality standards.</p></div>
